{"v":15,"id":"e04","kid":"emma","title":"Honeybees: Small but Important","zh":"蜜蜂：小身体，大作用","level":"B1","genre":"自然","src":"facts","sum":"介绍蜜蜂的群体生活、蜂王与工蜂的分工、用\"摇摆舞\"传递花的位置，以及它们为农作物传粉的重要作用和保护方法。","words":294,"paras":[{"t":"A honeybee is only a little more than one centimeter long, but it is one of the most important insects on Earth.","w":[[0,1,"a",-1],[2,10,"honeybee",-1],[11,13,"is",-1],[14,18,"only",-1],[19,20,"a",-1],[21,27,"little",-1],[28,32,"more",-1],[33,37,"than",-1],[38,41,"one",-1],[42,52,"centimeter",-1],[53,57,"long",-1],[59,62,"but",-1],[63,65,"it",-1],[66,68,"is",-1],[69,72,"one",-1],[73,75,"of",-1],[76,79,"the",-1],[80,84,"most",-1],[85,94,"important",-1],[95,102,"insects",-1],[103,105,"on",-1],[106,111,"Earth",-1]]},{"t":"Honeybees live together in large groups called colonies. A strong colony can have tens of thousands of bees. Each colony has one queen. Her job is to lay eggs, and in summer she can lay more than a thousand eggs a day. Most of the other bees are female worker bees. They clean the hive, feed the young bees, make wax and collect food. There are also hundreds of male bees, called drones.","w":[[0,9,"honeybees",-1],[10,14,"live",-1],[15,23,"together",-1],[24,26,"in",-1],[27,32,"large",-1],[33,39,"groups",-1],[40,46,"called",-1],[47,55,"colonies",-1],[57,58,"a",-1],[59,65,"strong",-1],[66,72,"colony",-1],[73,76,"can",-1],[77,81,"have",-1],[82,86,"tens",0],[87,89,"of",0],[90,99,"thousands",0],[100,102,"of",0],[103,107,"bees",-1],[109,113,"each",-1],[114,120,"colony",-1],[121,124,"has",-1],[125,128,"one",-1],[129,134,"queen",-1],[136,139,"her",-1],[140,143,"job",-1],[144,146,"is",-1],[147,149,"to",-1],[150,153,"lay",1],[154,158,"eggs",1],[160,163,"and",-1],[164,166,"in",-1],[167,173,"summer",-1],[174,177,"she",-1],[178,181,"can",-1],[182,185,"lay",-1],[186,190,"more",-1],[191,195,"than",-1],[196,197,"a",-1],[198,206,"thousand",-1],[207,211,"eggs",-1],[212,213,"a",-1],[214,217,"day",-1],[219,223,"most",-1],[224,226,"of",-1],[227,230,"the",-