ength of the dance tells them how far to go.","w":[[0,3,"how",-1],[4,6,"do",-1],[7,11,"bees",-1],[12,16,"tell",5],[17,21,"each",5],[22,27,"other",5],[28,33,"where",-1],[34,37,"the",-1],[38,45,"flowers",-1],[46,49,"are",-1],[51,55,"they",-1],[56,61,"dance",-1],[63,67,"when",-1],[68,69,"a",-1],[70,76,"worker",-1],[77,82,"finds",-1],[83,87,"good",-1],[88,95,"flowers",-1],[97,100,"she",-1],[101,108,"returns",-1],[109,111,"to",-1],[112,115,"the",-1],[116,120,"hive",-1],[121,124,"and",-1],[125,129,"does",-1],[130,131,"a",-1],[132,139,"special",-1],[141,147,"waggle",6],[148,153,"dance",6],[156,159,"the",-1],[160,169,"direction",-1],[170,172,"of",-1],[173,176,"the",-1],[177,182,"dance",-1],[183,188,"tells",-1],[189,192,"the",-1],[193,198,"other",-1],[199,203,"bees",-1],[204,209,"which",7],[210,213,"way",7],[214,216,"to",-1],[217,220,"fly",-1],[222,225,"and",-1],[226,229,"the",-1],[230,236,"length",-1],[237,239,"of",-1],[240,243,"the",-1],[244,249,"dance",-1],[250,255,"tells",-1],[256,260,"them",-1],[261,264,"how",8],[265,268,"far",8],[269,271,"to",-1],[272,274,"go",-1]]},{"t":"While bees collect food, they also do something very useful for us. Pollen sticks to their hairy bodies and is carried from one flower to another. This helps plants make fruit and seeds. Many of the fruits and vegetables we eat, such as apples, strawberries and pumpkins, need help from bees and other insects.","w":[[0,5,"while",-1],[6,10,"bees",-1],[11,18,"collect",-1],[19,23,"food",-1],[25,29,"they",-1],[30,34,"also",-1],[35,37,"do",-1],[38,47,"something",-1],[48,52,"very",-1],[53,59,"useful",-1],[60,63,"for",-1],[64,66,"us",-1],[68,74,"pollen",-1],[75,81,"sticks",-1],[82,84,"to",-1],[85,90,"their",-1],[91,96,"hairy",-1],[97,103,"bodies",-1],[104,107,"and",-1],[108,110,"is",-1],[111,118,"carried",-1],[119,123,"from",-1],[124,127,"one",-1],[128,134,"flower",-1],[135,137,"to",-1],[138,145,"another",-1],[147,151,"this",-1],[152,157,"helps",-1],[158,164,"plants",-1],[165,169,"make",-1],[170,175,"fruit",-